<ContentLayout title="About" description="A doctoral researcher working across housing policy, urban governance, and political participation."><p>Hongliang Sun is a doctoral researcher in public administration at Shanghai Jiao Tong University. His research lies at the intersection of housing policy, urban governance, political economy, and political participation. He studies how housing systems and large-scale public interventions reshape inequality, community relations, and citizens’ engagement with public institutions.</p><h2>Research interests</h2><p>Housing Policy · Urban Governance · Political Economy · Public Administration · Housing Inequality · Grassroots Governance · Political Participation</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>{profile.school}<br/><a href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}>{profile.email}</a></p><h2>中文简介</h2><p>孙红亮，上海交通大学国际与公共事务学院公共管理专业博士研究生，研究兴趣主要包括住房政策、城市治理、政治经济学与基层政治参与。他关注住房制度和大规模公共政策干预如何改变城市不平等、社区关系以及居民与公共机构之间的互动。</p></ContentLayout>
